{"text": "After school, Ani goes to the library near her house. It is quiet and warm inside, and it smells of old books. The librarian smiles and helps her find a book about the stars. Ani sits at a big wooden table by the window and starts to read. She learns that some stars are much bigger than the sun. Before she leaves, she borrows two more books. 'See you next week!' says the librarian. Ani can't wait to come back.", "words": [[0.52, 0.8], [0.86, 1.18], [1.42, 1.64], [1.72, 2.0], [2.06, 2.12], [2.16, 2.22], [2.28, 2.7], [2.78, 2.94], [3.02, 3.12], [3.22, 3.6], [4.96, 5.06], [5.1, 5.2], [5.26, 5.66], [5.72, 5.82], [5.86, 6.04], [6.1, 6.72], [7.04, 7.14], [7.16, 7.24], [7.3, 7.7], [7.74, 7.8], [7.86, 8.02], [8.08, 8.5], [9.88, 9.94], [10.0, 10.58], [10.7, 11.28], [11.5, 11.6], [11.66, 11.9], [11.92, 11.98], [12.04, 12.3], [12.34, 12.37], [12.4, 12.58], [12.62, 12.86], [12.88, 12.94], [13.0, 13.48], [14.9, 15.12], [15.26, 15.48], [15.52, 15.6], [15.64, 15.67], [15.76, 15.96], [16.06, 16.3], [16.38, 16.8], [16.86, 16.98], [17.02, 17.08], [17.14, 17.48], [17.72, 17.82], [17.88, 18.24], [18.3, 18.36], [18.44, 18.8], [20.18, 20.28], [20.38, 20.7], [20.74, 20.88], [20.96, 21.16], [21.24, 21.68], [21.72, 21.82], [21.84, 22.04], [22.14, 22.36], [22.4, 22.52], [22.56, 22.64], [22.7, 22.94], [24.34, 24.66], [24.7, 24.8], [24.88, 25.3], [25.38, 25.46], [25.52, 25.94], [26.0, 26.16], [26.22, 26.36], [26.4, 26.8], [26.84, 28.42], [28.48, 28.54], [28.6, 28.86], [28.94, 29.34], [29.54, 29.72], [29.76, 29.84], [29.88, 30.58], [32.08, 32.28], [32.38, 32.72], [32.8, 33.0], [33.06, 33.12], [33.18, 33.38], [33.4, 34.013]], "tag": "kokoro:bf_emma", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}